  _subtitle: The Wizard of the Emerald City
  _description: Rules the [[8953e80a-34c8-4e3a-8c5f-7164c508be78|Emerald City]] and
    appears to every visitor in a different shape. In truth he is a balloonist from
    Omaha who drifted into Oz and was taken for a great wizard. He leaves in his
    [[a3d3ab26-213a-4f1f-8bf5-a9075758d024|Balloon]].
